				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-553d39a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="553d39a" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;_ha_eqh_enable&quot;:false}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d0d550c" data-id="d0d550c" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6b9dc19 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="6b9dc19" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="877" height="620" src="https://midwivesrevisionuganda.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/pyelonephritis-intro-1-1.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-7006" alt="" srcset="https://midwivesrevisionuganda.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/pyelonephritis-intro-1-1.jpg 877w, https://midwivesrevisionuganda.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/pyelonephritis-intro-1-1-300x212.jpg 300w, https://midwivesrevisionuganda.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/pyelonephritis-intro-1-1-768x543.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 877px) 100vw, 877px" />															</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e7aeb10 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="e7aeb10" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-left: 0.4499969482421875pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #ead1dc; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">ACUTE PYELONEPHRITIS </span></h2><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; text-indent: 0.07199859619140625pt; margin: 0pt 4.7125244140625pt 0pt 0.5400009155273438pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">This is characterized by </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">acute inflammation </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">of the </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">parenchyma</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">(core substance of the kidney/kidney tissue) and the </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">pelvis </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">of the kidneys. </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; text-indent: 0.07199859619140625pt; margin: 0pt 4.7125244140625pt 0pt 0.5400009155273438pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The disease may be </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">bilateral </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">or </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">unilateral</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">. This usually results from </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">untreated bacterial cystitis</span> <span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">and may be </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">associated with pregnancy, trauma of the urinary bladder</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, and </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">urinary obstruction Also Ascending and Descending infections.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; text-indent: 0.07199859619140625pt; margin: 0pt 4.7125244140625pt 0pt 0.5400009155273438pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #fff2cc; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Presentation</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">; </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">flunk tenderness,</span></p><ul><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">fever, chills </span></li><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Dysuria</span></li><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Urgency</span></li><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">frequency</span></li></ul><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #ead1dc; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Chronic pyelonephritis </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; text-indent: -0.08100128173828125pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.08100128173828125pt; margin: 0pt 0.8724365234375pt 0pt 0.5309982299804688pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">This occurs due </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">vesicoureteral reflux</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> (</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> back flow</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> of </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">urine </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">from the </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">bladder </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">to the </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">ureters </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">allowing spread of infection upwards to the kidneys. The condition is also called </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">reflux nephropathy</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">(This can lead to kidney distention called </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Hydronephrosis</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">) </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; text-indent: 0.02700042724609375pt; margin: 0pt 8.19854736328125pt 0pt 0.51300048828125pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">It clinical presents with </span></p><ul><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">bacteriuria, </span></li><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">hypertension, </span></li><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">flunk tenderness,</span></li><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">septic shock, </span></li><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">dizziness fainting and signs of renal insufficiency </span></li></ul>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-e623095 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="e623095" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;_ha_eqh_enable&quot;:false}">
