</script>				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-90fe11b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="90fe11b" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;_ha_eqh_enable&quot;:false}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-19cb324" data-id="19cb324" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-08185ab elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="08185ab" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="850" height="637" src="https://midwivesrevisionuganda.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Transmission.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-6986" alt="" srcset="https://midwivesrevisionuganda.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Transmission.webp 850w, https://midwivesrevisionuganda.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Transmission-300x225.webp 300w, https://midwivesrevisionuganda.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Transmission-768x576.webp 768w" sizes="(max-width: 850px) 100vw, 850px" />															</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-288b251 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="288b251" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<h4 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 15pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #ead1dc; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Transmission</span><span style="font-size: 13pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">:</span></h4><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #fff2cc; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Vector</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">: The disease is transmitted by </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">copepods</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, tiny crustaceans found in stagnant water.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #d9ead3; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Lifecycle</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">:</span></p><ul><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #fff2cc; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">In the Copepod (Vector)</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">:</span></li></ul><ol><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Copepods ingest the infective larvae of </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Dracunculus medinensis</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> from contaminated water.</span></li><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The larvae develop into infective stage within the copepod.</span></li></ol><ul><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #fff2cc; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">In Humans (Host)</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">:</span></li></ul><ol><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Humans become infected when they drink contaminated water containing the infected copepods.</span></li><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">In the human stomach, the copepod is digested, releasing the larvae.</span></li><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The larvae penetrate the intestinal wall and migrate through the body, typically reaching subcutaneous tissue (beneath the skin).</span></li><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Larvae mature into adult worms within one year.</span></li><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The female worm migrates to the surface of the skin and emerges from a blister, usually on the legs or feet.</span></li><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The worm releases larvae into the water, continuing the cycle.</span></li></ol><h4 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #ead1dc; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Routes of Transmission:</span></h4><ul><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #fff2cc; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Drinking Contaminated Water</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">: This is the primary route of transmission.</span></li></ul><h4 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #ead1dc; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Causes/Aetiology:</span></h4><ul><li dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; background-color: #ffffff;" role="presentation"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #fff2cc; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Dracunculus medinensis</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: #fff2cc; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> Worm</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">: The disease is caused by the </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Dracunculus medinensis</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Poppins,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> nematode.</span></li></ul>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5edc7f0 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="5edc7f0" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;_ha_eqh_enable&quot;:false}">
